vTJa6bDv3Sa5Pq.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Cleo dalle 5 alle 7","overview":"Una cantante aspetta un referto, sicura di essere molto malata. D'un tratto, nella sua vita di ragazza egoista e viziata, s'insinua una nuova emozione che le apre gli occhi: la paura della morte. Quel giorno nota anche lei parecchie cose, alle quali non aveva badato prima."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Cléo from 5 to 7","overview":"Agnès Varda eloquently captures Paris in the sixties with this real-time portrait of a singer set adrift in the city as she awaits test results of a biopsy. A chronicle of the minutes of one woman’s life, Cléo from 5 to 7 is a spirited mix of vivid vérité and melodrama, featuring a score by Michel Legrand and cameos by Jean-Luc Godard and Anna Karina.","tagline":"The whole world... has made an appointment with..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Cléo, belle et chanteuse, attend les résultats d'une analyse médicale. De la superstition à la peur, de la rue de Rivoli au Café de Dôme, de la coquetterie à l'angoisse, de chez elle au Parc Montsouris, Cléo vit quatre-vingt-dix minutes particulières. Son amant, son musicien, une amie puis un soldat lui ouvrent les yeux sur le monde.","tagline":"Le monde entier a pris rendez-vous avec."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z50gvTngGZth0N3tiR972xuZyP2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oyatchDPpS4I9jpIIezFJGrmXcR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":499,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z50gvTngGZth0N3tiR972xuZyP2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/z50gvTngGZth0N3tiR972xuZyP2.jpg","language":"it","width":939,"height":1409},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"